  "prefLabel": "Puc 1102.02 “Public utility”, “steam utility” or “utility” means any “public utility” as defined in RSA 362:2 owning, operating or managing any plant or equipment or any pa",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1102.02 “Public utility”, “steam utility” or “utility” means any “public utility” as defined in RSA 362:2 owning, operating or managing any plant or equipment or any part of the same for the manufacture or furnishing of steam for the public in the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter heading Puc 1100) #6445, eff 1-28-97; ss by #8244, eff 12-31-04; ss by #10307, eff 4-9-13",
